# src/apps/daemon/internal/runtime/decoy

## Purpose
Daemon-owned background decoy-traffic runtime with explicit start/cancel/join lifecycle and bounded request work.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `runtime` (rank 4; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (2): `manager.go`, `manager_test.go`

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `decoy`.
- Notable exported surface: `Manager`, `New`.
- Daemon-local dependencies: `internal/foundation/remoteaction`.
- Direct daemon callers: `cmd`.

## Invariants
- Background work is daemon-owned, cancellation-aware, and joined before Stop returns.
- `runtime` code must not import a higher-rank daemon band.

## Navigation
- Read this file first, then direct child `.context` files before editing a deeper folder.
